  m_GameObject: {fileID: 582947210}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4f5af0e9b0b149f79ab9a8e5cdd1f251, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TicGame.Architecture::TicGame.Architecture.CardTimeGuideUI
  guide: 'Activate: press J + K together, both mouse side buttons, or LB + RB on
    a gamepad.


    Card Time slows the world while you choose. The HUD shows which
    window is available: Neutral, Chain, or Finisher. Each window offers different
    cards.


    Read each card''s effect and Energy cost. Press its displayed slot
    command to play it immediately. Attack or dash cancels selection; letting the
    timer expire also closes it. Release the activation buttons before trying again.


    Watch
    the Energy meter, effect indicators and hit feedback. Playing a card and landing
    an enhanced attack are separate actions. Experiment with positioning and timing.


    Cyan
    seals respond to card-enhanced melee. Energy wells let you recharge and retry.'
